---
description: FOLIO secrets — env only, rotate chat-pasted keys
globs: .env*,src/lib/adapters/**/*.ts,src/lib/**/*.functions.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

# Secrets

- Read secrets via `process.env` / server-only modules — never `VITE_` for private keys.
- `.env` is gitignored; commit `.env.example` with empty values only.
- Keys pasted in chat are compromised for hygiene — prefer rotation after sprint.
- Do not write secret values into `memory/*`, rules, README, or PR bodies.